---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Frequently Asked Questions | Suyos del Inca">
  <section class="faq-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
      <p class="intro">
        Here are some common questions from our travelers about our tours,
        logistics, and visiting Quillabamba. If you don’t see your question
        here, feel free to <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="faq-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Getting Here</h2>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How do I get to Quillabamba?</h3>
        <p>
          Quillabamba is located in the Cusco region of Peru, about 200 km north
          of the city of Cusco. The most common way to reach it is by road — a
          scenic drive of about 6–7 hours that crosses the Andes and descends
          into the tropical cloud forest. There are daily buses and shared vans
          (“colectivos”) from Cusco to Quillabamba, or we can help arrange
          private transportation for your group.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Is there an airport in Quillabamba?</h3>
        <p>
          Currently, there are no commercial flights to Quillabamba. The nearest
          airport is in Cusco (Alejandro Velasco Astete International Airport),
          where most travelers begin their journey before continuing by road.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="faq-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Before Your Tour</h2>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What should I bring for the tours?</h3>
        <p>
          We recommend comfortable walking shoes, light clothing for warm days,
          a jacket for cooler evenings, sunscreen, insect repellent, a reusable
          water bottle, and any personal medications. For hikes or nature tours,
          bring a hat, rain protection, and your camera!
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Do I need to be in good shape for the tours?</h3>
        <p>
          Most of our tours are suitable for anyone with a moderate fitness
          level. Some treks involve uneven terrain or higher altitudes, so let
          us know your preferences and we’ll match you with the right experience.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Are meals included?</h3>
        <p>
          Many of our full-day and multi-day tours include traditional meals
          prepared with local ingredients. Check your tour details for what’s
          included, or ask us when booking.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="faq-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>General Questions</h2>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>When is the best time to visit Quillabamba?</h3>
        <p>
          The best time to visit is during the dry season, from May to October.
          During this time, you’ll enjoy warm, sunny days and clear skies.
          However, Quillabamba’s tropical climate makes it a pleasant destination
          year-round.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Do I need to speak Spanish?</h3>
        <p>
          While Spanish is the main language in the region, our guides speak
          both Spanish and English. We’ll make sure you feel comfortable and
          understand everything during your experience.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How can I book a tour?</h3>
        <p>
          You can book directly through our <a href="/tours">Tours</a> page or
          by <a href="/contact">contacting us</a>. We’ll confirm your booking
          and send you all the details by email.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .faq-hero {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0b1b2b, #193a59);
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 5rem 1rem;
    }

    .intro {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 1rem auto 0;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .faq-section {
      padding: 4rem 1rem;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .faq-item {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
      padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .faq-item h3 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .faq-item p {
      color: #FFFFFF;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    h2 {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    a {
      color: #c9a14a;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
